🧠 Insights from Word Cloud

* Larger words → more frequent
* Identify dominant themes
* Spot keywords instantly
* Helps guide deeper NLP analysis

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

⚠️ Limitations of Word Clouds

* No semantic meaning
* Frequency ≠ importance
* Can be misleading if data is not cleaned
* Not suitable for precise analysis

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

✅ Best Practices

* Clean text properly
* Remove stopwords carefully
* Use domain-specific stopwords
* Use word cloud only for exploration
* Combine with statistical analysis

